# Cloud agent conventions

- This repo is the default Cloud Agent workspace. Skills live in `.cursor/skills/`; do not look in `~/.cursor`.
- Use the Atlassian HTTP MCP for Jira and Confluence. Authenticate at cursor.com/agents if a tool returns `needsAuth`.
- Read the existing page or issue before changing it. Do not invent keys, IDs, or content.
- Ask before creating a Jira issue or Confluence page unless the user explicitly asked to create one.
- Never commit secrets, tokens, or environment files.
- From Slack, skills are invoked in natural language (`use update-confluence-page`), not IDE slash commands.
